[00:12.42]1. God has commanded us this day;
[00:17.18]He has given us a charge to obey.
[00:23.04]At all times, be ready to impart
[00:28.88]The reason for the hope within your heart.
[00:33.82](Chorus)
[00:33.88]So preach the word
[00:36.92]So that ev’ryone can hear!
[00:39.88]Preach the word,
[00:42.68]For we know the end is near.
[00:46.02]Preach the word,
[00:48.74]Help the meek to understand.
[00:51.72]Preach the word
[00:54.10]Throughout the land!
[01:07.28]2. Seasons of trouble we will face;
[01:10.80]Opposition may bring shame and disgrace.
[01:17.90]Though preaching may out of season seem,
[01:23.60]Our trust is in our God, who is supreme.
[01:28.76](Chorus)
[01:28.76]So preach the word
[01:31.72]So that ev’ryone can hear!
[01:35.14]Preach the word,
[01:38.06]For we know the end is near.
[01:40.98]Preach the word,
[01:43.74]Help the meek to understand.
[01:46.66]Preach the word
[01:49.04]Throughout the land!
[02:01.64]3. Seasons of favor we will see,
[02:07.18]And the need for us to teach, there will be.
[02:12.80]The way to salvation we proclaim
[02:18.48]And help to sanctify Jehovah’s name.
[02:23.70](Chorus)
[02:24.06]So preach the word
[02:26.76]So that ev’ryone can hear!
[02:30.10]Preach the word,
[02:33.00]For we know the end is near.
[02:35.64]Preach the word,
[02:38.68]Help the meek to understand.
[02:41.40]Preach the word
[02:44.02]Throughout the land!
